Future Enhancements (Out of Scope)

The following improvements were identified but are outside the scope of this spike:

Automatic lifecycle assignment using the Snyk API.
Automatic cleanup of obsolete release branch targets.
Automatic triggering of production scans following deployment.
Dynamic validation of user-selected Git branches before pipeline execution.
Additional reporting automation for production scan metrics.
Spike Outcome

The proof of concept successfully demonstrated that the existing DevOps test scan pipeline can be enhanced with minimal changes to support configurable branch scanning.

The evaluation also confirmed that using master as the standard production branch provides a single authoritative production monitoring target, improving the accuracy and consistency of monthly Snyk vulnerability reporting.

The implementation aligns with the AppSec team's proposed production monitoring approach while minimizing changes to the existing DevOps pipeline and operational workflow.
